      "sha256": "666067dd376e5d4553b8fd554f855855819ad213ae825022d2a32dfa28431115"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "be5e944bb76744248fe391f2",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "10",
      "locator": "paragraph 10",
      "text": "DONATE",
      "sha256": "68273151ba9e5b8b4be02a8b29b432e6fb2ff029d75c3eaa3514dc6052d52db2"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "502378c2352ade5455c53348",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "11",
      "locator": "paragraph 11",
      "text": "A Champion for Working Families",
      "sha256": "9e7c58220d218813f3e1c4c6f8f7e4d560cad96a05fca2c731388647aaa30f2d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "650ec9eb21d9534115476996",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "12",
      "locator": "paragraph 12",
      "text": "The economy is simply is not working for everyday Georgians right now. As your next representative in the Georgia State House, Carlos Vilela will be a progressive leader who fights to relieve the financial squeeze on our communities, protect our fundamental freedoms and build a future that works for everyone.",
      "sha256": "e4c92a255acaffe68e5a7ab403dab5a815ab2d7156b5e9f49744db5ab324dbbe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17558cc541975d2bd5d6d583",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "13",
      "locator": "paragraph 13",
      "text": "Here’s Carlos Vilela’s plan for Georgia:",
      "sha256": "d488fba2985269e014b75287cd65182829ed8d3e913fbc3097496c55db90243d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "a8983b13508d8a51b47d2e4a",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "14",
      "locator": "paragraph 14",
      "text": "Lowering the Cost of Living",
      "sha256": "f04556ff4aa7e0a98b4b02d134eb06e7a31ca2d90bd93b9359ed29b62f07b271"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b93b0f6ae6ec39df854a04ad",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "15",
      "locator": "paragraph 15",
      "text": "The economy is failing everyday Georgians. The cost of living is the #1 concern for Georgia families. With gas prices climbing and everyday necessities becoming more expensive, families are feeling the squeeze. You should never have to choose between a doctor’s visit and childcare, or between groceries and the power bill. Carlos Vilela will fight to:",
      "sha256": "c1f37388a10274d8a57937a633f89b97555dc78e6c3e2ac2f46d4bd92bd024d3"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "0dccf9a932ffe77144c70999",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "16",
      "locator": "paragraph 16",
      "text": "Protect Homeownership: Stop corporate speculators from buying up single-family homes and driving up prices in our neighborhoods.",
      "sha256": "149e5c276501221877e9cbeebb4f50e33e9beb4511bd9fd3f0c9ea41bbd1e16b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "c0c6ad7489cc53fb2b580565",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "17",
      "locator": "paragraph 17",
      "text": "Lower Daily Costs: Combat price gouging and advocate for policies that put more money back in the pockets of working families.",
      "sha256": "b27836c98c1bce8f435ae5e6748e754d3ea78352fc5fdde12079604c9a58908a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00de4413862199a177bf89a2",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "18",
      "locator": "paragraph 18",
      "text": "Defending Our Democracy",
      "sha256": "7525d3e06fd7070a4ebf3e07bcbc7cd47a7513dfbca799334089c4afe69a2a0b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "ea2cba7a62f29b720183b9b2",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "19",
      "locator": "paragraph 19",
      "text": "Carlos Vilela isn't afraid to take on the MAGA extremists who threaten our way of life. Carlos will stop any attempt to undermine our elections and is fighting so every eligible Georgian can vote securely, fairly and without any outside interference. Carlos is ready to fight for our fundamental rights, our freedoms, and the integrity of our elections. Our democracy is not for sale, and our votes will not be silenced.",
      "sha256": "4dcf62c4ba4ae13d221bfb86b258ff4258c14b459be8dc681df71c57de1646f6"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "c901f4a8819b7c7332ebf308",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "20",
      "locator": "paragraph 20",
      "text": "Building a Fair Economy & Cutting Taxes",
      "sha256": "487cff3d940c7f8bdf6a465807e76207f5669284ce44fad9091d10efd82efac7"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "699ee3437a4450f7b4b25181",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "21",
      "locator": "paragraph 21",
      "text": "True affordability requires an economy that creates good-paying jobs right here in District 42. Carlos believes our tax system should reward hard work, not just political connections.",
      "sha256": "21761fb92bad524a841b02c14f13db6504d24b83199340a43b32159a4cfc5d27"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "f9f4cf9c0793d09d7e6dddb4",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "22",
      "locator": "paragraph 22",
      "text": "Carlos Vilela is committed to:",
      "sha256": "17cc965249aff9027b877764e87d08284663784823764e0a378cfb7e4dce07c8"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "2a85d8cf1f37429095b95dc6",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "23",
      "locator": "paragraph 23",
      "text": "Middle-Class Tax Relief: Cutting taxes for working families and small businesses who actually need the help.",
      "sha256": "e6cbd1d29369874990e4b5e6693fe8d3dcc73731e9a643cd00ae8f1154bac8c4"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "3a2c6fc9a029345b643a1e05",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "24",
      "locator": "paragraph 24",
      "text": "Ending Corporate Giveaways: Ensuring massive corporations and the \"politically connected\" lose their insider tax breaks and finally pay their fair share.",
      "sha256": "ea4f4b7862c6ac642f6ba808cca18320b1e284505cd9f2318544d5ee4c3610f6"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "96decff9e0535badad4d7879",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "25",
      "locator": "paragraph 25",
      "text": "Protecting Reproductive Freedom",
      "sha256": "a539e46eb08d5f3afe661e02416e3664a746000a19ed4e9b7a00f0234e4c703a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "f6e7f5944593855b8c82b4ef",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "26",
      "locator": "paragraph 26",
      "text": "Personal medical decisions are just that: personal. Carlos Vilela has made protecting reproductive healthcare a top priority because a woman’s health should be decided by her and her doctor—not by extremist politicians in the General Assembly. He will stand as a firewall against government interference in our most private lives.",
      "sha256": "828276676a9711f9d32aac36532dff50466ce72b1eb5ae394cfd2ae3a88bdac2"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "670c66284038d9483e6c7d3c",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "27",
      "locator": "paragraph 27",
      "text": "Expanding Educational Opportunity",
      "sha256": "48a7788ea1c28e7a749184f60d0466bf912e293e97038c6b1cc6d0b3a0f2a141"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "053c7515253525fd7ffb4fd8",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "28",
      "locator": "paragraph 28",
      "text": "Education is the engine of our state’s future, and that engine starts early. Carlos knows that brain development doesn't wait for kindergarten.",
      "sha256": "f4804684a5fb8cfe298783683966c52d2762bfd9f97ead9b8819f55c66edcc4f"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "50de803bb9a5ab1a587d8efa",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "29",
      "locator": "paragraph 29",
      "text": "Carlos will fight to:",
      "sha256": "cf2f15463d2662e5152d4b32c7282ebf78fc068a3f995f67125d21e0e05500e9"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "3fb177c32fd2fc791d45be21",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "30",
      "locator": "paragraph 30",
      "text": "Expand Georgia’s Pre-K: Ensure every child has access to a quality head start that doesn’t break the bank for Georgia families.",
      "sha256": "df1d0ca165ceadd3bbd6e3165e62c44c3bcf886022c800fb164409e4fb527ca1"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "f5b155b825bc75f7da6a9832",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "31",
      "locator": "paragraph 31",
      "text": "Defend the HOPE Scholarship: Fiercely protect our merit-based aid so that a college degree is never out of reach because of a student's zip code or bank account.",
      "sha256": "b11a8d30e32bfea8f339feb915884de74401d21b879264cc2d0dce5f6d465b3f"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "d5fd9b0fd0ce33bfe605d21f",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "32",
      "locator": "paragraph 32",
      "text": "Enhancing Public Safety & Strengthening Our Courts",
      "sha256": "7d68a33e8ac4f13b929658188df00ef985bd2b49bd31077f9cf4578cecf39880"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "877883929111e6fac208b586",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "33",
      "locator": "paragraph 33",
      "text": "Public safety is about more than just enforcement; it’s about a justice system that people can trust. Carlos will ensure our legal system delivers fairness, accountability, and genuine security for all neighborhoods. He is committed to keeping our courthouse doors open to all and ensuring our judiciary remains impartial and apolitical.",
      "sha256": "b68ffb752ec278151c4deb7e3ee7c64534844b3ff402978abb9ceec1380447ca"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "d02f956a1cc0ef1de069212c",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "34",
      "locator": "paragraph 34",
      "text": "Ready to fight for a Georgia that works for all of us?",
      "sha256": "db7bc1dd75383752832d044ceafd5ebe48c1d6fa43162271a75c8a69ca1f14bb"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "03636af136152123075b9fc5",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "35",
      "locator": "paragraph 35",
      "text": "Join the Campaign and Volunteer Today | Chip in to Support Carlos Vilela for State House",
      "sha256": "ba2f20dd1e734cd127eb9ddce45021ce42d4ad6f1baf7bef4f528706c3f1df50"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b31108b32ad6cad919532436",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "36",
      "locator": "paragraph 36",
      "text": "Fill out the form to get in touch with us about volunteer opportunities, events or what you think would improve District 42.",
      "sha256": "d2b7012f2900971397d67e022af983a0ae7ff002b170422cbc5258a95dbae238"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "be52986638146031806a7e6a",
      "document_id": "replacement-vilela-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "37",
